  "title": "Visteon Expands Its Premium Cockpit Portfolio with 12.3-inch Narrow Border Display",
  "summary": "Visteon Corporation (NASDAQ: VC), a global leader in automotive cockpit electronics, today announced that its 12.3-inch Narrow Border Driver Display is featured in the recently launched Lexus ES. This marks Visteon's first production program in Lexus driver information systems, further expanding the company's footprint across the global premium automotive segment. Key Highlights: The 12.3-inch Narrow Border Driver Display is engineered for premium in-cabin environments and includes: Full LCD pan",
